<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Clayton Homes raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Clayton Homes raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Clayton Homes Inc to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Clayton Homes gained 1/4 to 14-7/8.</p>
</text>
